                        "review": "When I saw the game at first, It sorta got my intrest. Most people said this looked very like a FNaF Fangame and in which I sorta agree on. I wanted to give it a try and see how the game was like.\n\nPros:\n-Great music and ambience\n-Really good looking renders and maybe models?\n\nCons:\n-Frustrating AI, need to have the speed of Sonic to react.\n-Not enough tips/infomation given to beat the level (At least one tip or two would be good enough)\n\nI want to like this game but I can't, maybe I'll give it a better review another time or so when it's updated maybe.",
